      "excerpt": "/**\n * A JavaScript string value (ECMA-262, 4.3.17).\n */\nclass V8_EXPORT String : public Name {\n public:\n  static constexpr int kMaxLength =\n      internal::kApiSystemPointerSize == 4 ? (1 << 28) - 16 : (1 << 29) - 24;\n\n  enum Encoding {\n    UNKNOWN_ENCODING = 0x1,\n",
