      "excerpt": "Maybe<bool> v8::Object::Set(v8::Local<v8::Context> context,\n                            v8::Local<Value> key, v8::Local<Value> value) {\n  auto i_isolate = reinterpret_cast<i::Isolate*>(context->GetIsolate());\n  ENTER_V8(i_isolate, context, Object, Set, i::HandleScope);\n  auto self = Utils::OpenDirectHandle(this);\n  auto key_obj = Utils::OpenDirectHandle(*key);\n  auto value_obj = Utils::OpenDirectHandle(*value);\n  has_exception =\n      i::Runtime::SetObjectProperty(i_isolate, self, key_obj, value_obj,\n                                    i::StoreOrigin::kMaybeKeyed,\n                                    Just(i::ShouldThrow::kDontThrow))\n          .is_null();\n  RETURN_ON_FAILED_EXECUTION_PRIMITIVE(bool);\n  return Just(true);\n",
      "production_basenames": [
        "native_node_stream_request.zig"
      ],
      "source_mapping": "Original Object::Set uses kDontThrow: false is not empty Maybe. Actual setter/proxy exception is preserved; nonwritable data false result continues."
    },
    {
      "id": "v8_has_policy",
      "authority": {
        "path": "C:\\Users\\adyba\\pi-zig\\worktrees\\modules-io-resume-20261018\\verification\\native-node-shutdown-wrap-sourceonly-20261020\\authority\\v8-api.cc",
        "bytes": 489340,
