      "excerpt_sha256": "3A2080B3BDDCCFD0CA382C334DF22E31002A7A502941D494BC1997A24715F562",
      "excerpt": "Maybe<bool> v8::Object::Has(Local<Context> context, Local<Value> key) {\n  auto i_isolate = reinterpret_cast<i::Isolate*>(context->GetIsolate());\n  ENTER_V8(i_isolate, context, Object, Has, i::HandleScope);\n  auto self = Utils::OpenDirectHandle(this);\n  auto key_obj = Utils::OpenDirectHandle(*key);\n  Maybe<bool> maybe = Nothing<bool>();\n  // Check if the given key is an array index.\n  uint32_t index = 0;\n  if (i::Object::ToArrayIndex(*key_obj, &index)) {\n    maybe = i::JSReceiver::HasElement(i_isolate, self, index);\n  } else {\n    // Convert the key to a name - possibly by calling back into JavaScript.\n    i::DirectHandle<i::Name> name;\n    if (i::Object::ToName(i_isolate, key_obj).ToHandle(&name)) {\n      maybe = i::JSReceiver::HasProperty(i_isolate, self, name);\n    }\n  }\n  has_exception = maybe.IsNothing();\n  RETURN_ON_FAILED_EXECUTION_PRIMITIVE(bool);\n  return maybe;\n",
      "production_basenames": [
        "native_node_stream_shutdown.zig"
      ],
      "source_mapping": "Has is an actual potentially throwing ordinary operation; the reporter's FromJust remains terminal on empty, not truthy coercion or caught false."
    }
